<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A4.SS10.SSS0.Px4" title="In D.10 Learned-ablation parameters ‣ Appendix D Empirical Appendix ‣ PostDeg: Placement Beats Parameterization in LayerNorm GNNs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Per-seed final <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A4.SS10.SSS0.Px5" title="In D.10 Learned-ablation parameters ‣ Appendix D Empirical Appendix ‣ PostDeg: Placement Beats Parameterization in LayerNorm GNNs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Per-seed dispersion of <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\alpha,\beta,\delta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\alpha,\beta,\delta)</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></a></li>
