</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS11" title="In Appendix D Empirical Appendix ‣ PostDeg: Placement Beats Parameterization in LayerNorm GNNs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.11 </span>Ablation staircase</span></a></li>
