<section id="A4.SS10.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Values at training-epoch checkpoints.</h4>

<div id="A4.SS10.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS10.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Snapshotting the parameters at training-epoch checkpoints (Table <a href="#A4.T25" title="Table A25 ‣ Values at training-epoch checkpoints. ‣ D.10 Learned-ablation parameters ‣ Appendix D Empirical Appendix ‣ PostDeg: Placement Beats Parameterization in LayerNorm GNNs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A25</span></a>) shows the time course. The exponent <math id="A4.SS10.SSS0.Px3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math> rises within the first <math id="A4.SS10.SSS0.Px3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="25" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>25</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">25</annotation></semantics></math>–<math id="A4.SS10.SSS0.Px3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="50" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>50</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">50</annotation></semantics></math> epochs and then stabilizes; the gate parameter <math id="A4.SS10.SSS0.Px3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math> and the spectral coefficient <math id="A4.SS10.SSS0.Px3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta</annotation></semantics></math> track similar curves. The per-seed visual companion is in Figure <a href="#A4.F19" title="Figure A19 ‣ Per-seed 𝛽 curve. ‣ D.10 Learned-ablation parameters ‣ Appendix D Empirical Appendix ‣ PostDeg: Placement Beats Parameterization in LayerNorm GNNs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A19</span></a> below.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.T25" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A4.T25.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table A25</span>: </span><span id="A4.T25.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">PostDeg-L-Adaptive learned parameters <math id="A4.T25.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\alpha,\beta,\delta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\alpha,\beta,\delta)</annotation></semantics></math> at six training-epoch checkpoints, averaged across all 3 GAT layers and 10 seeds (mean <math id="A4.T25.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math> std, 3 decimal places). The exponent rises sharply within the first <math id="A4.T25.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="25" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>25</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">25</annotation></semantics></math> epochs and then stabilizes.</span></figcaption>
