<section id="A4.SS10.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Per-seed final <math id="A4.SS10.SSS0.Px4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math>.</h4>

<div id="A4.SS10.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS10.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A4.T26" title="Table A26 ‣ Per-seed final 𝛽. ‣ D.10 Learned-ablation parameters ‣ Appendix D Empirical Appendix ‣ PostDeg: Placement Beats Parameterization in LayerNorm GNNs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A26</span></a> reports per-seed final <math id="A4.SS10.SSS0.Px4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math> values, one row per seed, averaged across the three GAT layers. Across-seed standard deviations are <math id="A4.SS10.SSS0.Px4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leq 0.002" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.002</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leq 0.002</annotation></semantics></math> on every task; this is the source of the unusually low between-seed variance that drives Cohen’s <math id="A4.SS10.SSS0.Px4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math> above <math id="A4.SS10.SSS0.Px4.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="6" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>6</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">6</annotation></semantics></math> in Table <a href="#A4.T16" title="Table A16 ‣ Effect sizes and per-seed wins. ‣ D.7 Equivalence and ablations ‣ Appendix D Empirical Appendix ‣ PostDeg: Placement Beats Parameterization in LayerNorm GNNs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A16</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.T26" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A4.T26.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table A26</span>: </span><span id="A4.T26.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Per-seed final <math id="A4.T26.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math> values for the learned PostDeg-L-Adaptive ablation, averaged across the 3 GAT layers. Spread across seeds is below <math id="A4.T26.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.005" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.005</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.005</annotation></semantics></math> for every task. Source: <span id="A4.T26.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">dsn_spectral_weights.csv</span>, <span id="A4.T26.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">new_experiments_dsn_weights.csv</span>.</span></figcaption>
